 465:Src/main.c    ****   /* ll_aton leaves OctoSPI2 in indirect/DMA mode after MoveNet inference.
 466:Src/main.c    ****    * BSP_XSPI_NOR_DeInit has a linker issue (HAL_DMA_Abort relocation), so
 467:Src/main.c    ****    * we abort the hardware directly and force HAL state to READY. */
